# Exact generator paths intentionally adapted for this monorepo. Every entry needs a reason.
.gitignore :: Uses the epic's stable public skill name instead of the package-derived name.
package.json :: Integrates the scaffold into the monorepo and pins the gate toolchain.
pages/[locale]/docs/[[...slug]].tsx :: Root Prettier formatted the generated locale route without semantic changes.
pages/docs/[[...slug]].tsx :: Root Prettier formatted the generated default route without semantic changes.
pnpm-workspace.yaml :: The repository owns one root workspace file; a nested workspace is forbidden.
scripts/check-links.js :: Preserves the #161 robust HTML start-tag parser and strict-link regression fix.
src/content/docs/getting-started/index.mdx :: Replaces generic scaffold copy with the explicit temporary product placeholder.
src/content/docs/getting-started/installation.mdx :: Replaces generic scaffold copy with the explicit temporary product placeholder.
src/content/docs/getting-started/introduction.mdx :: Replaces generic scaffold copy with the explicit temporary product placeholder.
src/content/docs-ja/getting-started/index.mdx :: Adds the required Japanese temporary product placeholder and frontmatter.
src/content/docs-ja/getting-started/installation.mdx :: Adds the required Japanese temporary product placeholder and frontmatter.
src/content/docs-ja/getting-started/introduction.mdx :: Adds the required Japanese temporary product placeholder and frontmatter.
zfb.config.ts :: Applies repository URLs, navigation, version binding, Cloudflare adapter, and #161 link plugin.
